{"4358180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shadow Rush", "steam_appid": 4358180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/750e867216442ad867165feafbe5e657.webp?t=1782451724\" width=782 height=34 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadow Rush is an isometric hack-and-slash RPG with a unique combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are simple: WASD to move, left click to attack and right click to dash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUT, every time you attack OR dash, you cycle through 4 phases:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/0c357b910c3bde52a35076bca293d3ee.apng?t=1782451724\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/0c357b910c3bde52a35076bca293d3ee.poster.avif?t=1782451724\" class=\"bb_img\" width=186 height=54 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the phase, every time you attack or dash you will trigger special abilities based on your set-up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note the I, II, III, IV besides the equipment slots on the inventory</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/4c97e0cffdeff1ab44dbde77f2f3c896.avif?t=1782451724\" width=640 height=640 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The goal of the combat is to have a happy medium where you don't have to juggle multiple hotkeys like in an MMO, but it still  requires active input and not nearly hands-off like in a Vampire Survivors-like </strong>   <br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/670bd24ce62e6821c0a398a8851ff7df.poster.avif?t=1782451724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/670bd24ce62e6821c0a398a8851ff7df.webm?t=1782451724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/670bd24ce62e6821c0a398a8851ff7df.mp4?t=1782451724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/fb927c85e719cd84156b23e8b8d19b8b.webp?t=1782451724\" width=780 height=32 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look the game is called Shadow Rush not Shadow Tread Carefully</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry about trying to dodge every hit. Health pickups are plenty. Just be aggressive and focus on killing enemies as fast as you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In fact if you take too long, a gigantic wave of darkness will swallow up the entire arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/6306eab90505050644bc2cd7110219cc.poster.avif?t=1782451724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/6306eab90505050644bc2cd7110219cc.webm?t=1782451724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/6306eab90505050644bc2cd7110219cc.mp4?t=1782451724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing an arena, you can choose a bonus and move on to the next</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/0427d72e9550948b6c3dd975a646bb20.poster.avif?t=1782451724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/0427d72e9550948b6c3dd975a646bb20.webm?t=1782451724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/0427d72e9550948b6c3dd975a646bb20.mp4?t=1782451724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/727c65c9b2f480e5efb0f6d734c38608.webp?t=1782451724\" width=780 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choose 6 characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/10743326bcf3a7e620f2242350d52a14.avif?t=1782451724\" width=1560 height=866 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special abilities come in the form of collectable items known as 'Shards', which can be easily equipped, de-equipped and swapped between characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the perfect game breaking-build by customizing your characters' Shard Deck</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/750e867216442ad867165feafbe5e657.webp?t=1782451724\" width=782 height=34 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadow Rush is an isometric hack-and-slash RPG with a unique combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are simple: WASD to move, left click to attack and right click to dash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUT, every time you attack OR dash, you cycle through 4 phases:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/0c357b910c3bde52a35076bca293d3ee.apng?t=1782451724\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/0c357b910c3bde52a35076bca293d3ee.poster.avif?t=1782451724\" class=\"bb_img\" width=186 height=54 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the phase, every time you attack or dash you will trigger special abilities based on your set-up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note the I, II, III, IV besides the equipment slots on the inventory</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/4c97e0cffdeff1ab44dbde77f2f3c896.avif?t=1782451724\" width=640 height=640 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The goal of the combat is to have a happy medium where you don't have to juggle multiple hotkeys like in an MMO, but it still  requires active input and not nearly hands-off like in a Vampire Survivors-like </strong>   <br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/670bd24ce62e6821c0a398a8851ff7df.poster.avif?t=1782451724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/670bd24ce62e6821c0a398a8851ff7df.webm?t=1782451724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/670bd24ce62e6821c0a398a8851ff7df.mp4?t=1782451724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/fb927c85e719cd84156b23e8b8d19b8b.webp?t=1782451724\" width=780 height=32 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look the game is called Shadow Rush not Shadow Tread Carefully</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry about trying to dodge every hit. Health pickups are plenty. Just be aggressive and focus on killing enemies as fast as you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In fact if you take too long, a gigantic wave of darkness will swallow up the entire arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/6306eab90505050644bc2cd7110219cc.poster.avif?t=1782451724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/6306eab90505050644bc2cd7110219cc.webm?t=1782451724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/6306eab90505050644bc2cd7110219cc.mp4?t=1782451724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing an arena, you can choose a bonus and move on to the next</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/0427d72e9550948b6c3dd975a646bb20.poster.avif?t=1782451724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/0427d72e9550948b6c3dd975a646bb20.webm?t=1782451724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/0427d72e9550948b6c3dd975a646bb20.mp4?t=1782451724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/727c65c9b2f480e5efb0f6d734c38608.webp?t=1782451724\" width=780 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choose 6 characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358180/extras/10743326bcf3a7e620f2242350d52a14.avif?t=1782451724\" width=1560 height=866 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special abilities come in the form of collectable items known as 'Shards', which can be easily equipped, de-equipped and swapped between characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the perfect game breaking-build by customizing your characters' Shard Deck</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Slay hordes of Shadow Demons in this Action RPG with roguelike elements. Fast-paced combat, quick runs, build experimentation, and re-rolling characters. Spells are collectable, equip-able 'Shards' that trigger when you attack. CAN YOU BEAT THE SPEED OF DARKNESS?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/435